{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"希伯来书","commonName":"希伯来书","title":"希伯来书","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"88dfe968124b22760b2021a1ff05966bca10f085ce6d6eeba0253dacf63dd9ff","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":301},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶稣超越摩西"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["因此，同蒙天召的圣洁弟兄姊妹，你们应当仔细思想那位我们公认为特使和大祭司的耶稣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["祂向委任祂的上帝尽忠，就好像摩西向上帝的全家尽忠一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["然而祂却比摩西配得更大的荣耀，就好像建造房子的人比房子更尊贵一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因为房子都是人建造的，但建造万物的是上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["摩西以仆人的身份向上帝的全家尽忠，",{"noteId":11},"为将来要宣告的事做见证。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["但基督是以儿子的身份忠心治理上帝的家。我们若持定信念和引以为荣的盼望，就是祂的家了。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["不可存刚硬的心"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["因此，正如圣灵说：",{"text":"“你们今日若听见祂的声音，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不可心里顽固，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像从前在旷野试探祂、悖逆祂一样。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的祖先虽然在那里观看我的作为四十年之久，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却仍然试我、探我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我向那世代的人发怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"说：‘他们心向歧途，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不认识我的道路。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此我愤然起誓说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘他们绝不可进入我的安息。’","poem":1},{"noteId":12},{"text":"”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["弟兄姊妹，要谨慎，免得你们当中有人心存恶念，不肯相信，背弃了永活的上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["趁着还有今日，要天天互相劝勉，免得有人被罪迷惑，心里变得刚硬。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["如果我们将起初的信念坚持到底，便在基督里有份了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["圣经上说：",{"text":"“你们今日若听见祂的声音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不可心里顽固，像从前悖逆祂一样。”","poem":1},{"noteId":13}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["听见祂的声音却又悖逆祂的是谁呢？不就是摩西从埃及领出来的那些人吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["四十年之久惹上帝发怒的是谁呢？不就是那些犯罪作恶并倒毙在旷野的人吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["上帝起誓不准谁进入祂的安息呢？不就是那些不肯顺从的人吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["可见，他们不能进入上帝的安息是因为不信的缘故。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"民数记12:7。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":5}},{"noteId":12,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇95:7‑11。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":11}},{"noteId":13,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇95:7、8。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":19}